<body><header><a href="index.html">Chapala Theological Seminary</a></header><main id="content">
<section class="locale cts-reading" lang="en" aria-labelledby="title-en"><h1 id="title-en">Support Our Ministry</h1><p>Every course, examination, certificate, and study resource at Chapala Theological Seminary remains free. Financial gifts are entirely voluntary. They do not affect admission, study access, grades, certificates, degrees, or faculty attention.</p><p class="note">The PayPal.Me and Cash App payment profiles identify <strong>Wayne Cook</strong> as the recipient. These are personal payment profiles, not verified institutional nonprofit donation accounts.</p><div class="pay-options"><a class="action" href="https://paypal.me/cookww51" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Give with PayPal — Wayne Cook @cookww51">Give with PayPal</a><a class="action" href="https://cash.app/$Cookww" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Give with Cash App — Wayne Cook $Cookww">Give with Cash App</a></div><p class="small">No card details or payment amounts are collected on this website. Please review the recipient and amount in Cash App before sending. We do not claim that these gifts are tax-deductible.</p><p><a href="index.html">Back to the seminary</a></p></section>
<section class="locale cts-reading" lang="es" aria-labelledby="title-es"><h1 id="title-es">Apoye nuestro ministerio</h1><p>Todos los cursos, exámenes, certificados y recursos de estudio del Seminario Teológico de Chapala siguen siendo gratuitos. Las donaciones son completamente voluntarias y no afectan la admisión, el acceso, las calificaciones, los certificados, los títulos ni la atención del profesorado.</p><p class="note">Los perfiles de pago PayPal.Me y Cash App muestran a <strong>Wayne Cook</strong> como destinatario. Son perfiles de pago personales, no cuentas institucionales verificadas de una organización sin fines de lucro.</p><div class="pay-options"><a class="action" href="https://paypal.me/cookww51" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Donar con PayPal — Wayne Cook @cookww51">Donar con PayPal</a><a class="action" href="https://cash.app/$Cookww" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Donar con Cash App — Wayne Cook $Cookww">Donar con Cash App</a></div><p class="small">Este sitio no recopila datos de tarjetas ni cantidades de pago. Compruebe el destinatario y la cantidad en Cash App antes de enviar dinero. No afirmamos que estas donaciones sean deducibles de impuestos.</p><p><a href="index.html">Volver al seminario</a></p></section>
<section class="locale cts-reading" lang="fr" aria-labelledby="title-fr"><h1 id="title-fr">Soutenez notre ministère</h1><p>Tous les cours, examens, certificats et ressources d’étude du Séminaire théologique de Chapala restent gratuits. Les dons sont entièrement facultatifs et n’ont aucun effet sur l’inscription, l’accès aux cours, les notes, les certificats, les diplômes ou l’attention des enseignants.</p><p class="note">Les profils de paiement PayPal.Me et Cash App indiquent <strong>Wayne Cook</strong> comme bénéficiaire. Ce sont des profils personnels, et non des comptes institutionnels caritatifs vérifiés.</p><div class="pay-options"><a class="action" href="https://paypal.me/cookww51" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Faire un don par PayPal — Wayne Cook @cookww51">Faire un don par PayPal</a><a class="action" href="https://cash.app/$Cookww" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Faire un don par Cash App — Wayne Cook $Cookww">Faire un don par Cash App</a></div><p class="small">Ce site ne recueille ni coordonnées bancaires ni montant de paiement. Vérifiez le destinataire et le montant dans Cash App avant tout envoi. Nous n’affirmons pas que ces dons donnent droit à une déduction fiscale.</p><p><a href="index.html">Retour au séminaire</a></p></section>
<section class="locale cts-reading" lang="sw" aria-labelledby="title-sw"><h1 id="title-sw">Saidia huduma yetu</h1><p>Masomo yote, mitihani, vyeti na nyenzo za masomo katika Seminari ya Theolojia ya Chapala hubaki bure. Michango ni ya hiari kabisa. Haitabadilisha uandikishaji, upatikanaji wa masomo, alama, vyeti, shahada au msaada wa walimu.</p><p class="note">Wasifu wa malipo wa PayPal.Me na Cash App unaonyesha <strong>Wayne Cook</strong> kama mpokeaji. Hizi ni akaunti binafsi za malipo, si akaunti zilizothibitishwa za taasisi isiyo ya faida.</p><div class="pay-options"><a class="action" href="https://paypal.me/cookww51" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Changia kupitia PayPal — Wayne Cook @cookww51">Changia kupitia PayPal</a><a class="action" href="https://cash.app/$Cookww" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Toa mchango kwa Cash App — Wayne Cook $Cookww">Toa mchango kwa Cash App</a></div><p class="small">Tovuti hii haikusanyi taarifa za kadi wala kiasi cha malipo. Hakikisha mpokeaji na kiasi katika Cash App kabla ya kutuma pesa. Hatusemi kuwa michango hii inaweza kupunguzwa kwenye kodi.</p><p><a href="index.html">Rudi kwenye seminari</a></p></section>
</main><footer>Chapala Theological Seminary · <a href="mailto:info@chapalaseminary.org">info@chapalaseminary.org</a></footer></body></html>
